# Build context for deploy/demo/Dockerfile (the public demo image). Only what the image copies is needed;
# everything else stays out of the context, especially local data, secrets and build output.
**
!pyproject.toml
!config/default.yaml
!ledgerspy/**
!ledgerspy_demo/**
!frontend/**
!data/synthetic/reference/**
!deploy/demo/requirements-linux.lock
!tests/**
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/*.ledgerspy.db
